    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. one thing though, i'm a bit worried about the incision area. sometimes it looks fine on the surface but then it gets really red and hot underneath. how do i tell if something is actually going wrong deep inside without having to poke at her too much? like how do i know if it's just a minor thing or something more serious like an abscess forming?",
